    "description": "it's 2001. mud on the windscreen, waterfalls everywhere and the jungle's louder than your engine. 🏁\nY2K drum & bass in the spirit of Rollcage Stage II and the PS1 racing era: breakbeats, rolling bass and that late 90s / early 2000s game soundtrack energy.\n\nPut it on for driving, gaming, coding, studying or just staring out the window pretending you're in a loading screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTRACKLIST\n00:00 Waterfall\n01:58 Treeline Protocol\n04:13 Deep Monsoon\n06:28 Wet Season Protocol\n08:45 Canopy\n11:00 Night Boost\n13:13 Mudslide Theory\n15:29 Fern Gully\n17:41 Kingfisher\n19:54 Riverbend Loop\n22:11 Rainmaker Protocol\n24:25 Redline Loop\n26:41 Traction Loop\n28:57 Final Overgrowth\n31:09 Silent Vine\n33:25 High Humid\n35:40 Turbo Approach\n37:56 Undergrowth Sprint\n40:08 Lost Downpour\n42:22 Silent Kickdown\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏎️ Visuals: Digital Aura Racing Team\n🎛️ Music: original tracks generated with custom Python scripts\n💿 Inspired by the sound of Rollcage Stage II and classic PS1 racers. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or its publishers.\n\nIf this takes you back, drop your favourite old racing game in the comments and subscribe for more Y2K DnB.\n\n#y2kdnb #drumandbass #ps1",
